@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

database "MySQL\n业务数据库" as MySQL

rectangle "核心业务数据" {
  [sales_record\n销售记录] as SalesRecord
  [product\n商品表] as Product
  [customer\n客户表] as Customer
}

rectangle "算法与结果" {
  [ml_pipeline.py] as Pipeline
  [sales_forecast\n预测结果表] as Forecast
  [alert_rule / alert_log\n预警规则与日志] as AlertData
  [user_profile\n用户画像表] as Profile
  [训练模型文件] as Model
}

MySQL --> SalesRecord
MySQL --> Product
MySQL --> Customer

Pipeline --> SalesRecord : 读取历史销量
Pipeline --> Product : 读取商品库存
Pipeline --> Customer : 读取客户信息
Pipeline --> Model : 加载模型

Pipeline --> Forecast : 生成销量预测
Pipeline --> AlertData : 生成预警结果
Pipeline --> Profile : 生成人群画像

note bottom of Pipeline
统一负责销量预测、
异常检测、库存建议
和用户画像计算
end note
@enduml
